    {
      "text": "You wake up and discover you can pause time.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.35
    },
    {
      "text": "Ten seconds. Once a day.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.5
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, you use it for dumb things.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "You catch your falling coffee.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.4
    },
    {
      "text": "You dodge your boss in the hallway.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, on day twelve, a bus runs a red light.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.15
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a kid in the road.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "You hit pause.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "text": "You run.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine. Eight. Seven.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.5
    },
    {
      "text": "And then you notice something.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Someone else is still moving.",
      "gapAfterSec": 0.6
    },
    {
      "text": "And they're looking right at you.",
